%F A186865 Empirical: a(n) = 14576*n^2 - 77924*n + 99292 for n>4.
%F A186865 From _Elmo R. Oliveira_, Oct 14 2026: (Start)
%F A186865 G.f.: 4*x^3*(560 + 3988*x + 3194*x^2 + 11*x^3 - 465*x^4) / (1 - x)^3.
%F A186865 E.g.f.: 4*exp(x)*(24823 -15837*x +3644*x^2) + (-99292 -35944*x -874*x^2 +2768*x^3/3 +155*x^4/2).
%F A186865 a(n) = 3*a(n-1) - 3*a(n-2) + a(n-3) for n > 7. (End)
